              ↓
//4. Take one node
              ↓
//5. Add it to answer
              ↓
//6. Remove its dependency from neighbors
              ↓
//7. If a neighbor now has 0 prerequisites,
   put it in Queue
              ↓
//8. Repeat

//time complexity: O(V + E) where V is the number of vertices and E is the number of edges.
